":{"ko_KR":"90/145/200/255/310","en_US":"90 / 145 / 200 / 255 / 310","zh_CN":"90 / 145 / 200 / 255 / 310"},"impact":"buff"},{"id":"official/6/2/0","valueType":"text","sourceKey":"official/6/2/0","gameDataKey":"Mel/abilities/R/cooldown","label":{"ko_KR":"최초 기본 피해량","en_US":"Initial Base Damage","zh_CN":"初始基礎傷害"},"section":"R","sectionName":{"ko_KR":"황금 일식","en_US":"Golden Eclipse","zh_CN":"鎏金蚀日"},"before":{"ko_KR":"100/150/200","en_US":"100 / 150 / 200","zh_CN":"100 / 150 / 200"},"after":{"ko_KR":"125/200/275","en_US":"125 / 200 / 275","zh_CN":"125 / 200 / 275"},"impact":"buff"}],"impact":"adjustment"},{"id":"Neeko","kind":"champion","name":{"ko_KR":"니코","en_US":"Neeko","zh_CN":"万花通灵"},"changes":[{"id":"official/7/0/0","valueType":"text","sourceKey":"official/7/0/0","gameDataKey":"Neeko/abilities/W/cooldown","label":{"ko_KR":"조금 더 얌전해진 니코","en_US":"Slightly-Less-Tricksy-Neekoses","zh_CN":"稍微不那麼狡猾的妮可"},"section":"W","sectionName":{"ko_KR":"형상 분리","en_US":"Shapesplitter","zh_CN":"两生花影"},"before":{"ko_KR":"","en_US":"","zh_CN":""},"after":{"ko_KR":"재사용 대기시간이 이제 사용 시점이 아니라 분신이 사라진 시점부터 시작됩니다.","en_US":"Cooldown now starts on clone expiration, instead of on cast","zh_CN":"稍微不那麼狡猾的妮可 現在冷卻是在分身消失後開始，而不是在施放後"},"impact":"adjustment"},{"id":"official/7/0/1","valueType":"text","sourceKey":"official/7/0/1","gameDataKey":"Neeko/abilities/W/cooldown","label":{"ko_KR":"장난 금지","en_US":"Fun Eliminated","zh_CN":"樂趣消失"},"section":"W","sectionName":{"ko_KR":"형상 분리","en_US":"Shapesplitter","zh_CN":"两生花影"},"before":{"ko_KR":"","en_US":"","zh_CN":""},"after":{"ko_KR":"니코가 이제 분신에게만 농담 표현을 출력하던 Ctrl+5 단축키를 더 이상 사용하지 못하게 됩니다. 하지만, 농담이나 춤, 귀환을 이용해 분신이 행동하게 만드는 것은 여전히 가능합니다.","en_US":"Neeko can no longer use Ctrl+5, which plays the joke expression for clone only. Neeko can still joke, dance, recall, to make their clone initiate said actions.","zh_CN":"妮可現在無法使用Ctrl+5，這個指令原本只會讓分身使用玩笑表情。妮可仍然可以開玩笑、跳舞、回城，讓她的分身施展該項動作。"},"impact":"adjustment"}],"impact":"adjustment"},{"id":"Nocturne","kind":"champion","name":{"ko_KR":"녹턴","en_US":"Nocturne","zh_CN":"永恒梦魇"},"changes":[{"id":"official/8/0/0","valueType":"text","sourceKey":"official/8/0/0","label":{"ko_KR":"재사용 대기시간","en_US":"Cooldown","zh_CN":"冷卻時間"},"section":"P","sectionName":{"ko_KR":"그림자 칼날","en_US":"Umbra Blades","zh_CN":"暗影之刃"},"before":{"ko_KR":"13초","en_US":"13","zh_CN":"13"},"after":{"ko_KR":"12초","en_US":"12","zh_CN":"12"},"impact":"buff"},{"id":"official/8/1/0","valueType":"text","sourceKey":"official/8/1/0","gameDataKey":"Nocturne/abilities/Q/cooldown","label":{"ko_KR":"추가 이동 속도","en_US":"Bonus move speed","zh_CN":"額外跑速"},"section":"Q","sectionName":{"ko_KR":"황혼의 인도자","en_US":"Duskbringer","zh_CN":"梦魇之径"},"before":{"ko_KR":"15/20/25/30/35%","en_US":"15 / 20 / 25 / 30 / 35%","zh_CN":"15 / 20 / 25 / 30 / 35%"},"after":{"ko_KR":"20/25/30/35/40%","en_US":"20 / 25 / 30 / 35 / 40%","zh_CN":"20 / 25 / 30 / 35 / 40%"},"impact":"buff"}],"impact":"buff"},{"id":"Orianna","kind":"champion","name":{"ko_KR":"오리아나","en_US":"Orianna","zh_CN":"发条魔灵"},"changes":[{"id":"official/9/0/0","valueType":"text","sourceKey":"official/9/0/0","gameDataKey":"Orianna/abilities/Q/cooldown","label":{"ko_KR":"재사용 대기시간","en_US":"Cooldown","zh_CN":"冷卻時間"},"section":"Q","sectionName":{"ko_KR":"명령: 공격","en_US":"Command: Attack","zh_CN":"指令：攻击"},"before":{"ko_KR":"6/5.25/4.5/3.75/3초","en_US":"6 / 5.25 / 4.5 / 3.75 / 3","zh_CN":"6 / 5.25 / 4.5 / 3.75 / 3"},"after":{"ko_KR":"7/6/5/4/3초","en_US":"7 / 6 / 5 / 4 / 3","zh_CN":"7 / 6 / 5 / 4 / 3"},"impact":"nerf"}],"impact":"nerf"},{"id":"Samira","kind":"champion","name":{"ko_KR":"사미라","en_US":"Samira","zh_CN":"沙漠玫瑰"},"changes":[{"id":"official/10/0/0","valueType":"text","sourceKey":"official/10/0/0","gameDataKey":"Samira/abilities/Q/cooldown","label":{"ko_KR":"상황에 맞는 도구","en_US":"The Right Tool for the Job","zh_CN":"對症下藥"},"section":"Q","sectionName":{"ko_KR":"천부적 재능","en_US":"Flair","zh_CN":"交火"},"before":{"ko_KR":"","en_US":"","zh_CN":""},"after":{"ko_KR":"사미라의 Q - 천부적 재능이 이제 사미라의 양쪽에 유닛이 있는지 여러 번 확인합니다. 양쪽에 유닛이 있다면 그리고 무엇보다 멀리 있는 유닛이 없다면 칼 형태의 Q - 천부적 재능을 사용하고, 유닛이 사미라와 멀리 있다면 양쪽 유닛 여부와 상관없이 총 형태의 Q - 천부적 재능을 사용합니다.","en_US":"Samira Q will now do multiple additional checks to see if there are units on both the right and left of her. If there are, and importantly if there are no units far in front of her, she will use Sword Q. If a unit is far in front of her, she will still use Gun Q regardless of units on the right and left.","zh_CN":"煞蜜拉的Q技能現在會多次檢查左右是否有單位。如果左右有單位，且前方遠處沒有單位，她會使用劍Q。如果前方遠處有單位，不管左右有沒有單位，她都會使用槍Q。"},"impact":"adjustment"},{"id":"official/10/0/1","valueType":"text","sourceKey":"official/10/0/1","gameDataKey":"Samira/abilities/Q/cooldown","label":{"ko_KR":"쏘고 싶어 근질근질한 손가락","en_US":"Itchy Trigger Finger","zh_CN":"手癢快槍手"},"section":"Q","sectionName":{"ko_KR":"천부적 재능","en_US":"Flair","zh_CN":"交火"},"before":{"ko_KR":"","en_US":"","zh_CN":""},"after":{"ko_KR":"사미라의 Q - 천부적 재능이 기본 지속 효과 - 무모한 충동 사용 도중에 사용되던 현상이 수정됩니다. 이로써 사미라의 Q - 천부적 재능을 사용하지 않았음에도 기본 지속 효과 - 무모한 충동의 애니메이션 도중 Q - 천부적 재능 단축키를 누를 경우 재사용 대기시간이 적용되던 현상이 해결될 것입니다. 또한 W - 원형 검무 사용 후 R - 지옥불 난사가 사용되던 현상이 수정됩니다.","en_US":"Samira Q is now properly sealed during her passive. This resolves a case where Samira Q can go on cooldown despite not being used if pressed during her passive’s animation. This also applies to an instance where her ultimate was cast after her W.","zh_CN":"煞蜜拉的Q技能在她的被動期間現在會正確封鎖。修正前，煞蜜拉在被動動畫期間按下Q技能，即使沒有實際施放Q技能也會進入冷卻。這同樣適用於她在W技能後再施放大絕的情況。"},"impact":"adjustment"},{"id":"official/10/0/2","valueType":"text","sourceKey":"official/10/0/2","gameDataKey":"Samira/abilities/Q/cooldown","label":{"ko_KR":"걸어서 회피 방지","en_US":"Can’t Out-Walk Me","zh_CN":"走不贏我"},"section":"Q","sectionName":{"ko_KR":"천부적 재능","en_US":"Flair","zh_CN":"交火"},"before":{"ko_KR":"","en_US":"","zh_CN":""},"after":{"ko_KR":"이제 사미라의 Q - 천부적 재능을 사용할 경우, 적이 사미라와 반대쪽으로 이동하는지 그리고 칼 형태의 Q - 천부적 재능 범위의 끝자락에 있는지 확인하고, 만약 그렇다면 총 형태의 Q - 천부적 재능을 사용합니다. 이에 따라 느린 이동 속도로도 챔피언들이 Q - 천부적 재능의 범위 밖으로 걸어서 회피하는 극단적인 상황은 더 이상 발생하지 않을 것입니다. (다만 높은 이동 속도를 가진 챔피언은 여전히 회피할 수 있을 겁니다.)","en_US":"Samira Q will now do a check to see if the enemy is walking away from her and in the very last part of her Sword Q’s range. If so, she will instead use Gun Q. This should resolve the extreme cases where champions can simply walk away from her Q at very low move speed (higher move speeds will still likely be able to do so, rightfully.)","zh_CN":"煞蜜拉的Q技能現在會檢查敵人是否正往反方向移動，並且是否處於她劍Q範圍的最邊緣。在此情況下她會改用槍Q。此修正應該能解決對手能超低跑速躲過她的Q的問題（跑速較高的英雄還是能躲過）。"},"impact":"adjustment"}],"impact":"adjustment"},{"id":"Taliyah","kind":"champion","name":{"ko_KR":"탈리야","en_US":"Taliyah","zh_CN":"岩雀"},"changes":[{"id":"official/11/0/0","valueType":"text","sourceKey":"official/11/0/0","gameDataKey":"Taliyah/abilities/Q/cooldown","label":{"ko_KR":"기본 피해량","en_US":"Base Damage","zh_CN":"基礎傷害"},"section":"Q","sectionName":{"ko_KR":"파편 난사","en_US":"Threaded Volley","zh_CN":"石穿"},"before":{"ko_KR":"55/72.5/90/107.5/125","en_US":"55 / 72.5 / 90 / 107.5 / 125","zh_CN":"55 / 72.5 / 90 / 107.5 / 125"},"after":{"ko_KR":"50/67.5/85/102.5/120","en_US":"50 / 67.5 / 85 / 102.5 / 120","zh_CN":"50 / 67.5 / 85 / 102.5 / 120"},"impact":"nerf"},{"id":"official/11/0/1","valueType":"text","sourceKey":"official/11/0/1","gameDataKey":"Taliyah/abilities/Q/cooldown","label":{"ko_KR":"몬스터 대상 추가 피해량","en_US":"Bonus Monster Damage","zh_CN":"對野怪額外傷害"},"section":"Q","sectionName":{"ko_KR":"파편 난사","en_US":"Threaded Volley","zh_CN":"石穿"},"before":{"ko_KR":"20/25/30/35/40","en_US":"20 / 25 / 30 / 35 / 40","zh_CN":"20 / 25 / 30 / 35 / 40"},"after":{"ko_KR":"23/28/33/38/43","en_US":"23 / 28 / 33 / 38 / 43","zh_CN":"23 / 28 / 33 / 38 / 43"},"impact":"buff"}],"impact":"adjustment"},{"id":"Varus","kind":"champion","name":{"ko_KR":"바루스","en_US":"Varus","zh_CN":"惩戒之箭"},"changes":[{"id":"official/12/0/0","valueType":"text","sourceKey":"official/12/0/0","gameDataKey":"Varus/abilities/Q/cooldown","label":{"ko_KR":"최대 피해량","en_US":"Maximum damage","zh_CN":"最大傷害"},"section":"Q","sectionN